{"ref":"BDB, אֵלוֹן","hw":"אֵלוֹן","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>f.</strong>] <strong>terebinth (</strong>= <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:6\" href=\"/Genesis.12.6\">Gn 12:6</a> + 4 times; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלוֹנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:18\" href=\"/Genesis.13.18\">Gn 13:18</a> + 3 times—<em>terebinth</em> (or other tall tree, cf. infr. on <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.3\">1 S 10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:5\" href=\"/Judges.4.5\">Ju 4:5</a>), marking shrine, & hence used in topogr. designations; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מוֹרֶה</span> (<em>teacher’s terebinth</em>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:6\" href=\"/Genesis.12.6\">Gn 12:6</a> (v. Di) so <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.30\">Dt 11:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מְעוֹנְנִים</span> (<em>conjurors’ tereb.</em>) <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:37\" href=\"/Judges.9.37\">Ju 9:37</a>; distinguished by owner or ruler <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מַמְרֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:18\" href=\"/Genesis.13.18\">Gn 13:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:13\" href=\"/Genesis.14.13\">14:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:1\" href=\"/Genesis.18.1\">18:1</a>; by neighbouring town <span dir=\"rtl\">(ב)צענים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:11\" href=\"/Judges.4.11\">Ju 4:11</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בְּצַעֲנַנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:33\" href=\"/Joshua.19.33\">Jos 19:33</a> (edd. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוֹן</span>, but v. Norzi Baer Di); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵ׳ מֻצָּב אֲשֶׁר בִּשְׁכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:6\" href=\"/Judges.9.6\">Ju 9:6</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:4\" href=\"/Genesis.35.4\">Gn 35:4</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ תָּבוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.3\">1 S 10:3</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ דְּבוֹרָה</span> (& cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַלּוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַלּוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוֹן בָּכוּת</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:8\" href=\"/Genesis.35.8\">Gn 35:8</a>, & <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּמֶר דְּבוֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:5\" href=\"/Judges.4.5\">Ju 4:5</a>) cf. Ew<sup>Gesch. iii. 31</sup> Th Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:8\" href=\"/Genesis.35.8\">Gn 35:8</a> (v. also sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַלּוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַלּוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוֹן</a>).","next":"BDB, אֵלוֹן²","prev":"BDB, אֵלָה²"}